    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      276.19,
      451.19,
      305.06
    ],
    "text": "Clauses 2 and 3: These clauses amend the Mahapola Higher Education Scholarship TrustFund Act, No. 66 of 1981 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and otherwritten laws and the legal effect of the amendment is to replace the words\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      315.79,
      451.18,
      334.7
    ],
    "text": "(a)\u201cMahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund Act\u201d with the words \u201cLalithAthulathmudali Mahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund Act\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      155.71,
      345.43,
      451.2,
      364.46
    ],
    "text": "(b)\u201cMahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund\u201d with the words \u201cLalithAthulathmudali Mahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      375.19,
      451.18,
      404.06
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4: This clause amends section 15 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to extend the application of that section to the Trustees of theFund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      414.79,
      451.2,
      443.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5: This clause inserts a new section 15A in the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to make the provisions of the Offences Against PublicProperty Act, No. 12 of 1982 applicable to the properties of the Fund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      454.39,
      451.18,
      483.26
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6: This clause amends section 19 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof the section as amended is to replace the words \u201cMinister in charge of the subject of trade\u201dwith the words \u201cMinister who has been assigned the subject of Higher Education\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      493.99,
      451.19,
      512.9
    ],
    "text": "Clause 7: The provisions of this clause are consequential to the amendments made to theprincipal enactment by clauses 2 and 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
