      274.31
    ],
    "text": "Education Scholarship Trust Fund\u201d in any notice,notification, contract, communication, agreement, form orother document shall be read and construed as a reference tothe \u201cLalith Athulathmudali Mahapola Higher EducationScholarship Trust Fund Act\u201d and \u201cLalith AthulathmudaliMahapola Higher Education Scholarship Trust Fund\u201d.",
