  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      286.97,
      397.18,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 15 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words \u201cAll officers andservants of the Fund\u201d of the words \u201cAll officers, servants andTrustees of the Fund\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      346.97,
      397.18,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "5. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 15 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 15A of that enactment:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      210.19,
      394.97,
      397.19,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "15A. All movable and immovable propertyof the Fund shall be deemed to be publicproperty within the meaning of, and for thepurpose of, the Offences Against PublicProperty Act, No. 12 of 1982.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      482.93,
      397.19,
      530.27
    ],
    "text": "6. Section 19 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words \u201cMinister in chargeof the subject of Trade.\u201d of the words \u201cMinister who hasbeen assigned the subject of Higher Education.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      542.93,
      397.18,
      602.27
    ],
    "text": "7.For the avoidance of doubt it is hereby declared thatthe \u201cLalith Athulathmudali Mahapola Higher EducationScholarship Trust Fund\u201d, shall, for all purposes be deemedto be the successor to the \u201cMahapola Higher EducationScholarship Trust Fund\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      614.93,
      397.2,
      638.27
    ],
    "text": "8. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      404.11,
      616.15,
      452.12,
      654.02
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
